<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select rib, chuck and round cuts steady to weak, while loin cuts firm.  Choice cuts steady to firm. Beef trimmings steady to weak on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>263 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 12 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>35 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     107.48	106.68	102.19	101.54</p>
<p>Changes	   0.64	  0.51	 -0.07	  0.12</p>
<p>Rib	  162.93	159.32	149.89	148.85</p>
<p>Chuck	 75.14	 72.45	 74.94	 72.27</p>
<p>Round	 92.79	 92.79	 90.81	 90.81</p>
<p>Loin	 169.72	171.61	153.91	155.20</p>
